flowchart TD
  S([Start]) --> A["[Admin] Open draft version"]:::admin
  A --> B["Publish"]:::admin
  B --> C{"Content valid? questions,<br/>RACI R; A when approval;<br/>no required photo/QR/GPS"}
  C -- No --> E1["Fix first issue shown"]:::stop --> A
  C -- Yes --> D["Version published<br/>and locked"]:::system
  D --> F["Selectable for new tasks and<br/>new or edited schedules"]:::system
  F --> G{"Need changes later?"}
  G -- Yes --> H["Create new draft;<br/>existing tasks keep their snapshot"]:::admin --> A
  G -- No --> X([End])
  D --> R["Optional: retire version;<br/>schedules still on it stop<br/>with an error until edited"]:::admin --> X
